@archive 0000
@size 10

script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKingShadow
	"우리의 소원을 이루어 줄\n붉은 유성..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"오늘 밤도 여느 때처럼\n아름답게 빛나고 있군..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"머지않아 저 유성은 나와\n내 조직 딜러에게 막대한 힘을\n선사하겠지..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그렇지 않나, 하트리스?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"킹 님의\n말씀대로입니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKingShadow
	"퀸 티아, 잭..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"[Area0016]에서\n제법 괜찮은 성과를 올렸더군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"내 마음에 들었다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"정말 감사합니다...\n킹 님..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"킹 님께서 기뻐하시는 건\n다이아몬드 아이스에서 방출된\n크림슨의 양이"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"예상보다 많았기\n때문입니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"내 천재적인 지성이\n충분한 양의 크림슨과\n결합하면, 저 붉은 유성"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"메테오 G는 우리의 뜻대로\n움직이게 될 겁니다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러면 이 행성의\n사람들은 모두 딜러 앞에\n무릎 꿇겠지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"아무도 네 뜻을 거스르려 하지 않을\n거야. 네가 그들에게 설명해 주면"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"메테오 G가 지구를 강타하면\n어떻게 되는지 말이지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"아무리 어리석은 인간들이라도\n침묵할 수밖에 없겠지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"게다가 넌 이미\n수많은 아이들에게서"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"감사의 마음을 담은 이메일을\n받고 있잖아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"하하하...\n참으로 만족스럽군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"내 모든 계획이 순조롭게\n진행되고 있어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 누구도 나를 조금도\n의심하지 않지..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 고대의 힘까지\n손에 넣었지..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하하하..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"심판의 순간이 다가오고\n있다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"지루해..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"내가 정말 듣고 싶은 건\n록맨을 처리하러 가도 된다는\n허락뿐이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"어머나.\n기분이 꽤 안 좋은 모양이군?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"쳇!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"진정해, 잭."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Joker
	"킹 님께 너무 무례하게\n구는군요..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"입조심해, 임마."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"잭, 내가 뭐라고 했지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 5 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"록맨을 조사하는 건\n시간 낭비일 뿐이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러니 당장 가서\n그 녀석과 싸우게 해 줘."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"녀석이 눈치채지 못할 때\n기습해서 해치우면 돼.\n우리 계획을 알아차리면..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"잭, 그만해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"으악!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 6 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"잭이 무례하게 굴어 죄송합니다,\n킹 님..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"흥...\n잭..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 학교에서 너와 같은 나이의\n아이들과 함께 지낸 시간이"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너를 약하게 만든\n건가?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"뭐라고 했어!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"내 계획은 완벽하다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네가 입만 다물고\n있으면 아무 문제도\n생기지 않아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 내가 저 유성을\n손에 넣는 순간,"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"쓸모없는 인간들은 모두\n딜러 앞에 무릎 꿇게 될 거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그렇습니다... 인간은 정말\n약하고 부서지기 쉬운 어리석은\n존재들이죠."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그래서 인간들은 늘 새로운\n’브라더’를 맺고"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그들과 새로운 ’목적’을\n만들려고 서두르는 겁니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"인간에게는 자신들을 지배할\n내가 필요하다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"내가 이 행성에 새로운\n생명을 불어넣겠다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"진정한 삶의 이유가 무엇인지\n녀석들에게 보여 주지..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"모든 어리석은 인간은"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"딜러의 지배 아래 놓이게 될\n거야..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 7 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"하트리스, 내 명령은..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
