script 8 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"예, 알겠습니다.\n킹 님의 명령을 전하겠습니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"퀸 티아와 잭은\n계속해서 록맨에 대한\n데이터를 수집하도록."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 크림슨도 계속\n모아라."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"알겠습니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"흥..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Heartless
	"조커...\n킹 님께서 나중에 네게\n직접 명령을 내리실 거다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그때까지 대기하도록."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Joker
	"알겠습니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 9 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"크림슨을 꾸준히\n더 많이 모으고 있습니다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"메테오 G를 손에\n넣는 건\n시간문제입니다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 우리 계획의\n최우선 과제로 넘어가자..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"국립 WAZA 본부와\n사텔라 경찰을 박살 내겠다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"사텔라 경찰이라..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"록맨의 데이터만 충분히\n모으면 우리의\n궁극 병기가 완성된다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 병기가 WAZA와\n사텔라 경찰을 박살 낼 힘을\n우리에게 안겨 줄 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"실망시키지 마라,\n퀸 티아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"예, 킹 님..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
